{
 "esm": "2.0.0",
 "metadata": {
 "name": "cam_wv_saturation",
 "description": "CAM6 saturation specific humidity qsat (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the pointwise qsat law of wv_saturation.F90 (components/cam/src/atmos_phys/to_be_ccppized/wv_saturation.F90 of the instrumented cam6_4_212 fork) exactly as the SCAM dump window evaluates it, and the Goff-Gratch analytic laws that generate its vapor-pressure table. Two models: WvSaturation carries the run's law - es = estblf(T) from the estbl function table declared in this document (the 251-entry Goff-Gratch mixed-phase SVP table of wv_sat_init, wv_saturation.F90:191-254, generated from svp_trans of wv_sat_methods.F90:479-513 at T = 127.16..377.16 K), looked up by one application of the shared estbl_es0 template of cam_templates.esm (clamped to tmax = 375.16 K; cam_zm_evap.esm applies the same single law to its own identical table copy - the CLI resolves table_lookup only against the declaring document, see README.md), then qs = svp_to_qsat(es, p) and es = min(es, p) (svp_to_qsat of wv_sat_methods.F90:185-197), then the deriv_outputs chain (wv_saturation.F90:656-686): hltalt and tterm from calc_hltalt (F90:521-573, the mixed-phase branch; see cam_templates.esm), desdt = hltalt es / (rh2o t^2) + tterm, dqsdt = qs p desdt / (es (p - omeps es)) (0 when saturated), gam = dqsdt hltalt / cpair - the dumped gam (dqsdT) of qsat_line (F90:739-784). SvpTransLaw pins the analytic generation formula itself (goff_gratch_water/ice and the svp_trans blend of cam_templates.esm). The table lookup is CAM's estblf (F90:378-393): linear interpolation on t_tmp = clamp(T - tmin, 0, tmax - tmin) with flat clamps both ends (represented as table_lookup with interpolation linear / out_of_bounds clamp on min(T, tmax); the esm blend t_i + w (t_i+1 - t_i) differs from the Fortran (1 - w) t_i + w t_i+1 by at most 1 ulp). Tests are pinned to stage1/dumps/cam/cam_qsat.csv rows (step, phase, lev cited per test; es/qs/gam expected values are the dumped ones; hltalt/tterm are the Fortran-formula values from the stage-1 validator's python replica, which reproduces the dump to 1.8e-12 Pa on es), at rel 1e-12. Constants: rh2o = RWV = AVOGAD BOLTZ / MWWV = 461.5046398201599 J/(kg K), epsilo = MWWV/MWDAIR = 0.6219705862045155, omeps = 1 - epsilo = 0.3780294137954845, cpair = 1.00464e3 J/(kg K) (shr_const_mod.F90:24-55); tmin = 127.16 K, tmax = 375.16 K (wv_saturation.F90:95-96). Coverage note: the dump window spans T = 208.7..302.5 K, p = 364..92383 Pa, both phases, with pure-ice (T < 253.15), transition (253.15-273.15) and water (>= 273.15) branches all exercised; the saturated branches (p - es <= 0, qs = 1, dqsdt = 0) and the estblf clamps are not exercised by the dump and are pinned only by the law structure.",
 "tags": [
  "atmosphere",
  "cam",
  "saturation",
  "qsat",
  "dump-pinned",
  "cesm"
 ],
 "created": "2026-11-24T00:00:00Z",
 "authors": [
  "EqESM project contributors"
 ],
 "references": [
  {
   "citation": "CESM (Community Earth System Model), ESCOMP/CESM: CAM6 physics sources of the instrumented cam6_4_212 fork (components/cam/src/) - wv_saturation.F90, wv_sat_methods.F90 - the reference implementation these components are transcribed from.",
   "url": "https://github.com/ESCOMP/CESM"
  },
  {
   "citation": "EarthSciModels - the authoritative .esm corpus this component lives in.",
   "url": "https://github.com/EarthSciML/EarthSciModels"
  }
 ]
},
 "models": {
  "WvSaturation": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "./cam_templates.esm"
    }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "T": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "K",
     "default": 251.98635151617265,
     "description": "state temperature at the qsat call, t (wv_saturation.F90:739), [K]; dump column T"
    },
    "pmid": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "Pa",
     "default": 364.34657080165846,
     "description": "mid-layer pressure at the qsat call, p, [Pa]; dump column pmid"
    },
    "es0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa",
     "description": "unlimited saturation vapor pressure es = estblf(t) before the min(es, p) cap (wv_saturation.F90:741), [Pa]"
    },
    "es": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa",
     "description": "saturation vapor pressure es = min(es0, p) as dumped (wv_saturation.F90:745, qsat_line), [Pa]"
    },
    "qs": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "saturation specific humidity qs = svp_to_qsat(es0, p) (wv_sat_methods.F90:185-197), [kg/kg]"
    },
    "hltalt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "J/kg",
     "description": "latent heat of vaporization at t, calc_hltalt mixed-phase law (wv_saturation.F90:521-573, cam_templates.esm hltalt_mixed), [J/kg]"
    },
    "tterm": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa/K",
     "description": "transition-band d(es)/dT correction of calc_hltalt (wv_saturation.F90:548-573, cam_templates.esm tterm_transition), [Pa/K]"
    },
    "desdt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa/K",
     "description": "d(es)/dT of deriv_outputs (wv_saturation.F90:671-673): desdt = hltalt es / (rh2o t^2) + tterm, [Pa/K]"
    },
    "dqsdt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1/K",
     "description": "d(qs)/dT of deriv_outputs (wv_saturation.F90:676-679): dqsdt = qs p desdt / (es (p - omeps es)), zero when qs == 1, [1/K]"
    },
    "gam": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "dqsdt (hltalt / cpair), the dumped gam of qsat_line (wv_saturation.F90:683-686), dimensionless (K x 1/K)"
    }
   },
   "equations": [
    {
     "lhs": "es0",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "estbl_es0",
      "bindings": {
       "T": "T"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "qs",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "svp_to_qsat",
      "bindings": {
       "es": "es0",
       "p": "pmid"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "es",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "min",
      "args": [
       "es0",
       "pmid"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "hltalt",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "hltalt_mixed",
      "bindings": {
       "t": "T"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "tterm",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "tterm_transition",
      "bindings": {
       "t": "T"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "desdt",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           "hltalt",
           "es"
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": 461.5046398201599,
            "units": "J/(kg*K)"
           },
           {
            "op": "^",
            "args": [
             "T",
             2
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       "tterm"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "dqsdt",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "ifelse",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "==",
        "args": [
         "qs",
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 1.0,
          "units": "kg/kg"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 0.0,
        "units": "1/K"
       },
       {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           "qs",
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             "pmid",
             "desdt"
            ]
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           "es",
           {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
             "pmid",
             {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "const",
                "args": [],
                "value": 0.3780294137954845,
                "units": "1"
               },
               "es"
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "gam",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "/",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "dqsdt",
         "hltalt"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 1004.64,
        "units": "J/(kg*K)"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ],
